===Etymology===
From {{inh|gl|roa-opt|assi}}, from {{inh|gl|VL.|*ad sīc}}. Closely parallel to {{cog|rup|ashi}}, {{cog|pt|assim}}, {{cog|ro|așa}}, {{cog|es|así}}. Compare also {{cog|ca|així}}, {{cog|fr|ainsi}}, {{cog|it|così}}.

===Adverb===
{{gl-adv}}

# [[so]], [[thus]]

